 "origem": "gringa: Líbia (árabe): barragens de terra de Derna romperam por transbordo na tempestade Daniel, 2023 https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_Derna_dams_collapse ; https://eos.org/thelandslideblog/further-information-about-the-wadi-derna-dams",
 "titulo": "You built a dam out of dirt 🌊 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A DAM",
 "descripcion": "Clay core, gravel filter, spillway and rock armor: how an earth dam survives the storm. In 2023 two old earth dams above Derna, Libya, failed when floodwater poured over the top.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #dam #flood #howitworks #shorts",
 "tags": [
